  "foaf:name": "FISHTWIN",
  "sdo:name": "FISHTWIN",
  "sdo:description": "Fishtwin is a precision fisheries platform that aims to facilitate the application of digital twin analytics to help increase efficiency of commercial fishing operations and reduce carbon intensity. Deploying highly advanced predictive algorithms to provide simulations, analysis, and data-driven recommendations that can aid commercial fisheries in their quest to optimise fishing operations and management. From improving the detection of fish to reducing fuel consumption and emissions while decreasing bycatch.",
